sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Client as 📱 Client
    participant Route as 🛤️ Route
    participant Controller as 🎮 Controller
    participant Service as ⚙️ Service
    participant Database as 🗄️ Database
    participant SocketIO as 🔌 Socket.IO
    participant ConnectedClients as 👥 Connected Clients

    Note over Client,ConnectedClients: 🔗 POST /chat/:chatId/read → Socket.IO Flow

    Client->>+Route: POST /chat/:chatId/read
    Note right of Route: Middleware Chain
    Route->>Route: 🔐 auth(USER_ROLES.TASKER, USER_ROLES.POSTER)
    Route->>+Controller: MessageController.markChatRead()
    Controller->>+Service: MessageService.markChatAsRead()
    Service->>+Database: Message.find()
    Database-->>-Service: result
    Service->>+Database: Message.updateMany()
    Database-->>-Service: result

    Note over Service,ConnectedClients: 🔌 Real-time Socket.IO Events

    Service->>SocketIO: emit('MESSAGE_READ')
    Note right of SocketIO: Room: chat::{chatId}
    SocketIO-->>ConnectedClients: MESSAGE_READ → room

    Service-->>-Controller: result
    Controller-->>-Route: response
    Route-->>-Client: HTTP Response
